   Define `cross_marker_only` as abnormal eGFR and abnormal UACR separated by ≥90 days, in either order, without either same-marker confirmation pathway during that window. Calculate this before filtering to the primary cohort and report it separately. Specify its sensitivity index and apply the same adult and dialysis rules.

   Define `egfr_below_15_preindex` as any eligible calculated eGFR <15 on or before index. Keep this descriptive; it is not an additional exclusion.

